OL,3,GNEWSAFourteen people linked to
OL,4,Aevidential activity at time of Omagh
OL,5,Abomb, inquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FFourteen people have been linked to
OL,8,Fevidential activity in the days leading
OL,9,Fup to and on the day of the Omagh
OL,10,Fbombing, the inquiry into the explosion
OL,11,Fhas heard.
OL,13,FTwenty-nine people, including a woman
OL,14,Fpregnant with twins, died in the
OL,15,Fbombing in the County Tyrone town on 15
OL,16,FAugust 1998 - the biggest single
OL,17,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
OL,19,FIt came less than three months after
OL,20,Fthe people of Northern Ireland had
OL,21,Fvoted yes to the Good Friday Agreement.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
