OL,3,GNEWSAFourteen people linked to
OL,4,Aevidential activity at time of Omagh
OL,5,Abomb, inquiry told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry, which opened last year
OL,8,Fwith 14 days of testimony from bereaved
OL,9,Ffamilies and survivors, was established
OL,10,Fto determine if the bombing could have
OL,11,Fbeen prevented by UK state authorities.
